WEBVTT

NOTE Which coordinate becomes zero?. English captions; text is the exact narration script.

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.591
An intercept is where a
graph crosses an axis.

2
00:00:05.341 --> 00:00:08.873
For the y-intercept,
set the input x to zero.

3
00:00:09.523 --> 00:00:14.137
Our model gives zero, six: six
meters remain at the start.

4
00:00:15.087 --> 00:00:18.589
For the x-intercept, set
the output y to zero.

5
00:00:19.239 --> 00:00:22.762
The point eight, zero means
arrival after eight seconds.

6
00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:27.447
Check which coordinate is zero
before interpreting an axis crossing.
